# Raging Battle Mouse: "The second spell you cast each turn costs {1} less to cast." (CR 601.2f). Turn 1: Bot1 casts two Black
# Lotuses and, with one, the Mouse. Turn 2: Bot2 (no Mouse) casts its own Lotus first and Dancing Scimitar ({4}) second: the
# discount is Bot1's alone, so with 3 mana it is refused. Turn 3: with the untapped Lotus's 3 mana Bot1 can't cast the Scimitar
# as its first spell ({4}), then casts a Memnite (first) and the Scimitar (second) for {3} (the Lotus's three mana): the earlier turns' spells don't count.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus x2
Raging Battle Mouse
Dancing Scimitar
Memnite
Mountain x2
Mountain x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Dancing Scimitar
Mountain x5
Mountain x14

